uarter Slab block, which can be gotten by right clicking the block with a shovel. There are currently Turf blocks for all base game grass types.***\n- Added Crimson Fungus Crate\n- Added Warped Fungus Crate\n- Updated Crate Lids\n>***Crate Lids can now be placed leaning up against the sides of blocks.***\n- Added Nether Quartz Crate\n- Added Amethyst Crate\n- Added Echo Shard Crate\n- Added Pallet:\n>***The Pallet is yet another Quarter Slab block. It serves no purpose other than being a nice decorative block for you to build with.***\n- Added Diamond Pallet\n- Added Emerald Pallet\n- Many backend adjustments\n- Fixed crash at startup\n\n## Note:\nThis is part one of the full mod release. I'm breaking it up as just the first half already adds a bunch of new stuff, and the last version had unfinished blocks in it. Hopefully this update gets people excited for what is to come in the full release.", "changelog_url": null, "date_published": "2024-09-12T00:24:48.221610Z", "downloads": 1934, "version_type": "beta", "status": "listed", "requested_status": null, "files": [{"id": "VhbXvp39", "hashes": {"sha1": "127a80ed443f227d4fda1c5ae61b950d15bffc9d", "sha512": "cb610cadc5cb810f42a8fd00baddfe18d0206f68bb46a1678e8aeb09706b2b923979787952872c390ac0b0d2f9855b2692bf9fd869335a98ccf1293152490307"}, "url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/opsrwaeY/versions/a1bwy2CM/packedup-0.5.1-beta.jar", "filename": "packedup-0.5.1-beta.jar", "primary": true, "size": 880990, "file_type": null}], "dependencies": [{"version_id": null, "project_id": "R2OftAxM", "file_name": null, "dependency_type": "required"}]}, {"game_versions": ["1.20", "1.20.1"], "loaders": ["forge"], "environment": "client_and_server", "id": "rN9bKCLv", "project_id": "opsrwaeY", "author_id": "x0vND7vC", "featured": false, "name": "Packed Up - 0.2.6", "version_number": "0.2.6", "changelog": "- Fixed Netherrack Crates not dropping when broken\n## Note:\nSo I just noticed a couple blocks that are a part of the next update got slipped into this one. I will not be releasing any patch to finish those blocks and will instead be completed upon the next update. They can still be used, and are only missing their translation string/using old textures. Consider this a little preview of the next update. Sorry about the confusion this may have caused.", "changelog_url": null, "date_published": "2024-07-25T04:40:14.314824Z", "downloads": 2664, "version_type": "beta", "status": "listed", "requested_status": null, "files": [{"id": "URrPFFWo", "hashes": {"sha512": "bd28897ac1737410a2ad1331b28d31d8f4c8b765581db296ec1ff3bb60478679e91852027dc5be12ced51e20cdc0b354ff1b90229dea6158f3293fa948ec161e", "sha1": "c407685abc72992c4a71c6f8da92594b406fe219"}, "url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/opsrwaeY/versions/rN9bKCLv/packedup-0.2.6-beta.jar", "filename": "packedup-0.2.6-beta.jar", "primary": true, "size": 434728, "file_type": null}], "dependencies": [{"version_id": null, "project_id": "R2OftAxM", "file_name": null, "dependency_type": "required"}]}, {"game_versions": ["1.20", "1.20.1"], "loaders": ["forge"], "environment": "client_and_server", "id": "5XrXQp3n", "project_id": "opsrwaeY", "author_id": "x0vND7vC", "featured": false, "name": "Packed Up - 0.2.5", "version_number": "0.2.5", "changelog": "- Updated Japanese translations (Thanks to EndilCrafter!)", "changelog_url": null, "date_published": "2024-07-22T23:57:03.233968Z", "downloads": 259, "version_type": "beta", "status": "listed", "requested_status": null, "files": [{"id": "hCnUb3Pb", "hashes": {"sha512": "639da8fd0654b89ce902aba65a2fa6e9f93ef3ddf1ed71edbe435372ffe68e7372c152537ab9a49841e2c376a247f0cf8dd56a797edd5dbaa80f92fad023a374", "sha1": "223c4abacfe6e4e1dda18695062495e54d964bb9"}, "url": "https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/opsrwaeY/versions/5XrXQp3n/packedup-0.2.5-beta.jar", "filename": "packedup-0.2.5-beta.jar", "primary": true, "size": 402389, "file_type": null}], "dependencies": [{"version_id": null, "project_id": "R2OftAxM", "file_name": null, "depende